# Introduction
These are my documents and notes.

# Install packages
## Redhat / DNF
```
dnf install python3-pip git httpd mod_ssl mod_security httpd-tools
```
## Ubuntu
```
apt install python3-pip git apache2 python3.11-venv
```
# Build
```
mkdir /var/www/html/docs
cd /var/www/html/docs/
git clone https://github.com/rezizter/docs.git
mkdir /var/www/html/docs/overrides
ln -sf docs/mkdocs.yml mkdocs.yml
cd docs
python -m venv ~/.cache/venv/python
source ~/.cache/venv/python/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
mkdir /opt/scripts
cp /var/www/html/docs/docs/scripts/* /opt/scripts/
chmod +x /opt/scripts/build_site.sh
```
Now build the site
```
/opt/scripts/build_site.sh
```

# Apache config

```
<VirtualHost *:80>
    DocumentRoot "/var/www/html/docs/site"
    ServerName YOURDOMAIN.COM
    ServerAlias YOURDOMAIN.COM

<Directory "/var/www/html/docs/site">
        DirectoryIndex index.php index.html
        Order allow,deny
        Allow from all
</Directory>

RewriteEngine on
RewriteCond %{SERVER_NAME} =YOURDOMAIN.COM
RewriteRule ^ https://%{SERVER_NAME}%{REQUEST_URI} [END,NE,R=permanent]
</VirtualHost>
```

# LetsEncrypt

```
apt install certbot python3-certbot-apache
certbot --apache -d your_domain.com
certbot certificates
```

